# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.next/
out/

# NPM / Yarn / PNPM logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

